From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] deepseek-v4: MXFP4 decode v2 (fused act/sum) and CUDA deterministic align

Extends patch 0004. VLLM_DSV4_MXFP4_FUSED_ACT: the last warp of each w13
tile pair sums the split-K partials and applies clamp-silu-mul (bitwise equal
to sum + _C.silu_and_mul_with_clamp). VLLM_DSV4_MXFP4_FUSED_SUM (+ _ORDER=1):
w2 writes the top-k sum directly for <= 16 tokens (bitwise equal to
_moe_C.moe_sum). VLLM_DSV4_CUDA_DET_ALIGN: single-CTA CUDA deterministic
align, bitwise equal to the torch and Triton versions (3-6 us vs 17-89 us).
VLLM_DSV4_MXFP4_DQ=1|2 (cheaper dequant via pre-scaled activations; exact
weights, different fp32 order) is included but measured slower end to end
and is not enabled. All default off.

diff --git a/vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/dsv4_mxfp4_decode.py b/vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/dsv4_mxfp4_decode.py
index fee5473..a7b980a 100644
--- a/vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/dsv4_mxfp4_decode.py
+++ b/vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/dsv4_mxfp4_decode.py
@@ -18,6 +18,23 @@ VLLM_DSV4_MXFP4_DECODE_MAX_TOKENS (default 64) tokens, the compiled shapes
 (hidden 5120, intermediate 2304), and every e8m0 scale of the layer <= 128
 (checked once per weight tensor outside CUDA-graph capture). Anything else
 uses the unchanged Marlin path.
+
+v2 (``_dsv4_moe2`` ops in the same .so; every switch default off, each
+independent; all off == v1 behaviour bit for bit):
+  VLLM_DSV4_MXFP4_DQ=1|2          dequant without per-weight bf16 multiply
+                                  (scale applied per 32-k group in fp32;
+                                  scales up to 254 allowed). 0 = v1 dequant.
+  VLLM_DSV4_MXFP4_FUSED_ACT=1     split-K sum + clamp-silu-mul inside the
+                                  w13 kernel (bitwise == sum + _C op).
+  VLLM_DSV4_MXFP4_FUSED_SUM=1     moe_sum inside the w2 kernel, for at most
+                                  VLLM_DSV4_MXFP4_FUSED_SUM_MAX_TOKENS (16)
+                                  tokens; order VLLM_DSV4_MXFP4_FUSED_SUM_ORDER
+                                  (0 fp32 seq, 1 torch reduce [default],
+                                  2 bf16 seq; pick the one the GPU test
+                                  reports bitwise equal to _moe_C.moe_sum).
+  VLLM_DSV4_CUDA_DET_ALIGN=1      single-CTA CUDA deterministic moe align
+                                  (same outputs as fast_det_align), only
+                                  with VLLM_DETERMINISTIC_MOE_ALIGN.
 """
 
